 2.  **Mapping (Offline/Setup):** For each voxel at $(x, y, z)$, compute the bank index $k$ using the appropriate formula (Eq. 1 for orthographic, Eq. 4 for arbitrary) [S1, book]. Store the voxel data in bank $k$.
